# KiCad's own net names for hier.kicad_sch, from `kicad-cli sch export netlist` (10.0.6).
# Regenerate with hack/kicad_net_names.sh; do not hand-edit. Each line is a net name, a tab,
# then the ref.pin pairs on it, so the test can pair our nets with KiCad's by their pins.
unconnected-(R1-Pad1)	R1.1
unconnected-(R1-Pad2)	R1.2
unconnected-(R2-Pad1)	R2.1
unconnected-(R3-Pad1)	R3.1
